# What never belongs in an image (sp7-plan.md, T14).
#
# Two reasons, and the second is the important one: a smaller image builds and
# deploys faster, and a build context that cannot carry a secret cannot leak
# one. `.env` is excluded here as well as in `.gitignore`, because a file
# copied into a layer is in that layer forever, whatever the next line deletes.

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git
.github
.claude

node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build

# Test output, coverage, browser traces and screenshots.
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/coverage
**/.vitest

# Editor and OS noise.
.vscode
.idea
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log

# Documentation and plans: read in the repository, not shipped in an image.
docs
*.md
!README.md

# The local stack's own definitions.
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.prod.yml
infra
